  "details": "VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2021.11.24.16.20_Public (old) and\nVRCSDK3-AVATAR-2022.02.16.19.13_Public (current)\nPC build\nObscure error prevented even showing the avatar builder tab\nNullReferenceException: Object reference not set to an instance of an object\nVRC.SDK3.Editor.VRCSdkControlPanelAvatarBuilder3A.ValidateFeatures.ProcessStateMachine (at Assets/VRCSDK/SDK3A/Editor/VRCSdkControlPanelAvatarBuilder3A.cs:44)\nEventually I figured out it was caused by an completely empty layer inside an animationcontroller. That layer didn't even had the default Entry / All States / Exit nodes (no idea how that happened in the first place)\nMaybe add some more NULL checks in the SDK and give the user a meaningful error, so they at least know where to look.",
